invalid type: string "Sustainability (continued)\nWater and Compost\nRainwater is collected from the barn roofs into four large underground tanks and used\nto water the animals and the vegetable garden. In a normal year, rainwater provides\naround half of the farm's water needs.\nAnimal bedding, crop waste and food waste from the cafe are composted in large heaps\n\nrge from\nrnoon, every day\n…é¼